#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:410
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayShoppingLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, hey?\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, are you shopping, too?\p"
"I bought a whole bunch of DOLLS and\n"
"POSTERS.\p"
"Of course, I've also caught a lot of\n"
"POKéMON, and I'm raising them\l"
"properly, too.\p"
"Actually, I'm more worried if you're\n"
"raising POKéMON properly, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I'll battle with you, so you can show\n"
"me your POKéMON, {PLAYER}{KUN}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:423
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayNotRaisingPokemon"
msgid ""
"MAY: Oh, why? {PLAYER}{KUN}, haven't you\n"
"been raising your POKéMON?\p"
"That's not a very good showing as a\n"
"TRAINER…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:429
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayBattleMe"
msgid ""
"MAY: Come on, battle with me, so I can\n"
"check out your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayWontBeBeaten"
msgid ""
"MAY: The POKéMON I raised won't be\n"
"beaten by your POKéMON, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayDefeat"
msgid ""
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"I remember the battle I had with you,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, on ROUTE 103.\p"
"That battle helped you become this\n"
"strong, {PLAYER}{KUN}, didn't it?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:444
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayGoingBackToLittleroot"
msgid ""
"MAY: I'm thinking of going back to\n"
"LITTLEROOT soon.\p"
"I've caught a decent group of POKéMON,\n"
"and my POKéDEX is coming along, so\l"
"I'm going home to show my dad.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:451
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayYouGoingToCollectBadges"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Collect all the GYM BADGES and take\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE challenge?\p"
"Well, while you're collecting BADGES,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'm going to work on my\l"
"POKéDEX. I'll complete it before you!\p"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:460
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayYouGoingToPokemonLeague"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Are you taking the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"challenge?\p"
"Or, are you going to complete your\n"
"POKéDEX?\p"
"I might've lost to you in battling,\n"
"but I'll finish my POKéDEX before you!\p"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:470
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MayYouGoingToBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Are you taking the BATTLE FRONTIER\n"
"challenge?\p"
"Or, are you going to complete your\n"
"POKéDEX?\p"
"I might've lost to you in battling,\n"
"but I'll finish my POKéDEX before you!\p"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanShoppingLetsBattle"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Oh, hey, it's {PLAYER}.\p"
"I'm running an errand for my dad.\n"
"No, I'm not buying any DOLLS.\p"
"Anyways, it's been a while.\p"
"Want to have a battle to see who's been\n"
"raising POKéMON better?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:488
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanNoConfidence"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Oh, what's the matter?\n"
"Don't have the confidence?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:492
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanBattleMe"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Want to battle to see who's\n"
"been raising POKéMON better?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanWontBeBeaten"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: Aww, but you know I'm not\n"
"going to lose to no {PLAYER}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:500
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanDefeat"
msgid ""
"Humph…\n"
"You've done a lot of raising.\p"
"That stings a bit--I had a head start\n"
"on you as a TRAINER…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanGoingBackToLittleroot"
msgid ""
"BRENDAN: I…\n"
"I plan on going home to LITTLEROOT.\p"
"You know I'm helping out my dad on his\n"
"POKéDEX. It's coming together pretty\l"
"decently, so I should go show him.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:513
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanYouGoingToCollectBadges"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Collect all the GYM BADGES and take\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE challenge?\p"
"Maybe I'll do that, too…\p"
"Well, anyway, hang in there!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:520
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanYouGoingToPokemonLeague"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Since you're that strong, are you\n"
"taking the POKéMON LEAGUE challenge?\p"
"Heh, even me--if I trained my POKéMON\n"
"a bit more, I should be stronger than\l"
"you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"Well, anyway, hang in there!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:529
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_BrendanYouGoingToBattleFrontier"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}, what are you going to do?\p"
"Are you taking the BATTLE FRONTIER\n"
"challenge?\p"
"Or, are you going to complete your\n"
"POKéDEX?\p"
"Since you're that strong, you should\n"
"consider the BATTLE FRONTIER.\p"
"Heh, if I train my POKéMON a bit more,\n"
"I'll get stronger than you, {PLAYER}.\p"
"Maybe I should go to the BATTLE\n"
"FRONTIER.\p"
"Well, anyway, hang in there!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:543
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MovedLootIntoHideoutToday"
msgid ""
"Fufufu…\p"
"We moved more loot into our secret\n"
"HIDEOUT today…\p"
"Wh-who are you?!\n"
"I was just talking to myself!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:550
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ChanceToDoBigThings"
msgid ""
"I'm just a GRUNT, so I don't know what\n"
"the BOSS is thinking…\p"
"But being on TEAM AQUA, I know I'll get\n"
"the chance to do big things!\p"
"Wh-who are you?!\n"
"I was just talking to myself!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:558
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_DontGoNearCaveInCove"
msgid ""
"Hey, you!\p"
"Don't go near the cave in the cove!\p"
"Why? You don't need a reason why!\n"
"I'm an adult, so you just listen to me!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:564
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_IfWorldBecomesOurs"
msgid ""
"If this whole wide world becomes ours,\n"
"TEAM AQUA's, it will be a happier\l"
"place for POKéMON, too.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:569
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_WailmerLeapOutOfWater"
msgid ""
"There! WAILMER!\n"
"Leap out of the water now!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:573
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_GetLostMessingUpTraining"
msgid ""
"Hunh? What do you want?\p"
"You're messing up our training,\n"
"so can you, like, get lost?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:578
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ContestHallInTown"
msgid ""
"There's a POKéMON CONTEST HALL\n"
"right in this here town. \p"
"That means well-raised POKéMON will\n"
"come from all over the country.\p"
"My heart swells with excitement!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:585
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_StrangeCaveInCove"
msgid ""
"Have you seen that strange cave in\n"
"the cove at the edge of town?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:589
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_GoingToMoveDeleterForHMs"
msgid ""
"I'm going to teach my POKéMON some new\n"
"moves for entering a CONTEST.\p"
"So, I'm going to see the MOVE DELETER\n"
"and make it forget HM moves.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:595
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ImFromKanto"
msgid ""
"I came from KANTO.\p"
"The HOENN region is beautiful with\n"
"all its water and verdant nature.\p"
"Hunh? Wait a second…\p"
"Could there be rare POKéMON that live\n"
"only in this area?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:603
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_TeamAquaBeenTrainingWailmer"
msgid ""
"TEAM AQUA's been training their\n"
"WAILMER in the cove.\p"
"We SAILORS can't get our boats out\n"
"to sea with them in the way!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:609
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_SomeonePuntedTeamAquaOut"
msgid ""
"Ahoy, did you know?\p"
"Someone punted TEAM AQUA out of\n"
"the way for us!\p"
"That got the WAILMER out of the cove,\n"
"so we can get our boats out again.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:616
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_SomeoneStoleMyPokemon"
msgid ""
"I was taking a relaxing snooze at the\n"
"seaside inn to the sound of waves…\p"
"When someone stole my POKéMON!\p"
"Who's the abductor?\n"
"TEAM AQUA? Is it TEAM AQUA?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:623
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MissingPokemonCameBack"
msgid ""
"My missing POKéMON…\n"
"It came back without me noticing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:627
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ImArtDealer"
msgid ""
"I'm an ART DEALER.\p"
"I am a buyer and seller of fine art,\n"
"especially paintings.\p"
"I've heard that the MUSEUM here has\n"
"magnificent works on exhibit…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:634
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_SeaRemainsForeverYoung"
msgid ""
"Even as we grow old and wrinkled,\n"
"the sea remains forever young with\l"
"the vivid brilliance of life…\p"
"Fwohoho fwohohohoho…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:640
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_SixtyYearsAgoHusbandProposed"
msgid ""
"It was sixty years ago that my husband\n"
"proposed to me here.\l"
"The sea remains as beautiful as ever.\p"
"Mufufufu mufufufufufu…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:646
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_TeamAquaRenovatedCavern"
msgid ""
"Hm, you know of the peculiar cavern\n"
"in this cove?\p"
"That had been a natural formation,\n"
"but then that TEAM AQUA lot came\l"
"along and made their renovations.\p"
"They call themselves\n"
"the “nature-loving TEAM AQUA”!\p"
"But what they do and what they say\n"
"don't match at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:657
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_TeamAquaLotGoneForGood"
msgid ""
"That cave in the cove…\p"
"I didn't notice it right away,\n"
"but it's completely empty now.\p"
"That TEAM AQUA lot, they must\n"
"have gone away for good.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:664
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE CITY\p"
"“Where the land ends and the\n"
"sea begins.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:669
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ContestHallSign"
msgid ""
"POKéMON CONTEST HALL\n"
"“The gathering place for TRAINERS!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:673
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MotelSign"
msgid ""
"COVE LILY MOTEL\p"
"“Remember us as COVE LILY of\n"
"LILYCOVE.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:678
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MuseumSign"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE MUSEUM\p"
"“POKéMON Masterpiece Collection\n"
"on exhibit!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:683
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MuseumSignPlayersExhibit"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE MUSEUM\p"
"“{PLAYER}'s POKéMON Collection\n"
"on exhibit!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:688
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_HarborSignUnderConstruction"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE CITY HARBOR\p"
"“The ferry S.S. TIDAL is under\n"
"construction in SLATEPORT CITY.\p"
"“Service is scheduled to begin\n"
"shortly.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:695
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_HarborSign"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE CITY HARBOR\p"
"“Enjoy a delightful cruise on\n"
"the ferry S.S. TIDAL.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:700
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_TrainerFanClubSign"
msgid ""
"POKéMON TRAINER FAN CLUB\p"
"The names of TRAINERS are scribbled\n"
"all over the sign…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:705
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_DepartmentStoreSign"
msgid ""
"LILYCOVE DEPARTMENT STORE\p"
"“Overflowing with great merchandise\n"
"and excitement!\p"
"“A great place to find that something\n"
"you need!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:712
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_MoveDeletersHouseSign"
msgid ""
"MOVE DELETER'S HOUSE\p"
"“Unwanted POKéMON moves deleted.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:716
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_DoYouKnowAboutBerryBlender"
msgid ""
"Do you know about the machine\n"
"BERRY BLENDER?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:720
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_FasterSpinBetterPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"People have to work together to get it\n"
"to spin faster.\p"
"The faster you can make it spin, the\n"
"better {POKEBLOCK}S you can get, I've heard.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:726
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_ExplainBerryBlender"
msgid ""
"It's used for making a kind of candy\n"
"called a {POKEBLOCK}.\p"
"If you give a good {POKEBLOCK} to a POKéMON,\n"
"its condition will improve by a lot.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:732
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_HeardTowerCalledSkyPillar"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a tower somewhere out\n"
"on the sea routes.\p"
"It's called the SKY PILLAR, I hear.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:737
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_SawTallTowerOnRoute131"
msgid ""
"I saw this tall tower somewhere\n"
"around ROUTE 131.\p"
"Could that possibly be…?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:742
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_JustArrivedAndSawRarePokemon"
msgid ""
"We just arrived here on our\n"
"honeymoon vacation.\p"
"We happened to see a DRAGON-type\n"
"POKéMON flying way up in the sky.\p"
"Do cool POKéMON like that live in\n"
"the HOENN region?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity/scripts.inc:750
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_Text_HoneymoonVowToSeeRarePokemon"
msgid ""
"On our honeymoon, we vowed to see as\n"
"many rare POKéMON as we can.\p"
"So we were delighted to see a rare\n"
"POKéMON as soon as we arrived.\p"
"I mean, we are totally happy!$"
msgstr ""
